    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "The programs of study leading to the Ph.D. degree are organized by cluster below. Biomedical Sciences: Cancer, Immunology, Microbiology and Molecular Metabolism and Nutrition"
